{"id": "RT-about-mission", "body": {"t": "main", "a": {"class": "wrap", "id": "main-content"}, "c": [" ", " ", {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "kicker"}, "c": ["about"]}, " ", {"t": "h1", "c": ["Why this site exists"]}, " ", {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "article-meta"}, "c": [" ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "badge"}, "c": ["Last updated ", {"t": "time", "a": {"datetime": "2026-09-30"}, "c": ["30 September 2026"]}]}, " "]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "article-body"}, "c": [" ", {"t": "h2", "a": {"class": "sec sec-brief"}, "c": ["The short version"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["This project explains ADHD from inside the task and across levels of evidence, while offering usable supports and clear pathways to seek help. Its advocacy asks institutions to examine functional harm, treatment continuity and the consequences of delay with dated evidence."]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "a": {"class": "sec sec-misread"}, "c": ["The usual mix-up"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["“Visibility of a symptom equals knowledge of its cause.” A visible result cannot, on its own, explain the process behind it."]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "a": {"class": "sec sec-next"}, "c": ["Next"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["Begin with a lived problem, then follow evidence and options."]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "a": {"class": "sec sec-limit"}, "c": ["Limits"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["This page is general information. Personal experience varies. A source supporting a clinical framework does not automatically validate every suggested coping technique or prove an individual causal mechanism. Claims are dated, jurisdiction-limited where relevant, and should be corrected when stronger evidence changes the conclusion."]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "a": {"class": "sec sec-src"}, "c": ["Sources"]}, " ", {"t": "ul", "c": [" ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/ng87/chapter/recommendations", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["NICE NG87, current recommendations"]}]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36702997/", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["Demontis et al, Nature Genetics 2023; PMID 36702997; DOI 10.1038/s41588-022-01285-8"]}]}, " "]}]}, " ", {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "nextbox"}, "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Useful next destination."]}, " ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/contact/"}, "c": ["Contact the project"]}]}, " ", " ", {"t": "aside", "a": {"class": "lib-block", "aria-labelledby": "lib-heading"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "a": {"id": "lib-heading"}, "c": ["From the library"]}, {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "lib-note"}, "c": ["Dated articles, sources, visuals and downloads for this section, held in the MJB ADHD library on Google Drive and added to over time. ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/archive/"}, "c": ["How the library works"]}]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "lib-grid"}, "c": [{"t": "div", "a": {"class": "lib-repo", "id": "lib-about"}, "c": [{"t": "h3", "c": ["About & mission"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Why this site exists and how it is run."]}, {"t": "ul", "a": {"class": "lib-links"}, "c": [{"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Zbsm1k1juxdCbGwldDGJT8o4Tre6FUDS", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["Articles", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "visually-hidden"}, "c": [" for About & mission (opens Google Drive)"]}]}]}, {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UFDsC8OCvJ8E8R8hFmgIJVmdLezQe_7n", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["Sources", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "visually-hidden"}, "c": [" for About & mission (opens Google Drive)"]}]}]}, {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MHECZAhRkgwpPt-H_W1YPyvG7aM5IZGa", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["Visuals", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "visually-hidden"}, "c": [" for About & mission (opens Google Drive)"]}]}]}, {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kacYOZtYvmyUNC9eojlrYtBSE3-kfVIF", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["Downloads", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "visual